     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConjuntoValores / ConjuntoDeValores motivo-rechazo-muestra-laboratorio</b></p><a name=\"motivo-rechazo-muestra-laboratorio\"> </a><a name=\"hcmotivo-rechazo-muestra-laboratorio\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v2-0490.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0490</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 3.0.0\"> version ?3.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td><td><b>Spanish (es)</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v2-0490.html#v2-0490-QS\">QS</a></td><td>Quantity not sufficient</td><td>Quantity not sufficient</td><td>Cantidad insuficiente</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v2-0490.html#v2-0490-RC\">RC</a></td><td>Clotting</td><td>Clotting</td><td>Muestra coagulada</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v2-0490.html#v2-0490-RM\">RM</a></td><td>Labeling</td><td>Labeling</td><td>Muestra mal etiquetada</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
